<title>UK: London gold fixes just easier in holiday market.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes just easier in holiday market.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixed at $339.55 vs $340.15 previously. Very quiet so far with May Day holiday closing most of Europe. Little expected ahead of New York. Still bearish.</p>
<p>SILVER - Easier at $4.67/$4.69 with gold. Upside seen limited.</p>
<p>Test of $4.55 possible, although not today.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Touch firmer at $372.00/$373.00. Quiet.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Down $1.00 at $155.25/$156.25. Also quiet.</p>
</text>
